 ty\, USA\nVenue: Calvin L. Rampton Salt Palace Convention Center\n\nNot ye
 t announced: Notification of acceptance\n\nThe call for papers states no t
 imezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\
 , so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it.
 \n\nPapers are limited to five pages\, and panel proposals to a 350-word d
 escription. At least one author per accepted paper must register for the p
 aper to appear in IEEE Xplore. Notification of acceptance is expected by m
 id-October 2026\, without a stated date.\n\nCall for papers: https://pes-g
 ridedge.org/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines
 /conference/pes-grid-edge27
